   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03d34049848d55be5478",
   "sourceHash": "03d34049848d55be5478bfca6f6a1ca3f67e54e7709c559e8ae0b937c9341cc3",
   "text": "按照您的疗程开具的每日处方疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f73aa926ce42641455c6",
   "sourceHash": "f73aa926ce42641455c60b47912858ffd307a49a312a2558c694370da2d382bb",
   "text": "住院期间的草药及药剂",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9f47c3430869d5fc3ffd",
   "sourceHash": "9f47c3430869d5fc3ffd6c9dedcea375de07d24f21ac47e58606dd971d299817",
   "text": "每日瑜伽与冥想课程",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8e214977cab7200d7b08",
   "sourceHash": "8e214977cab7200d7b0804e0beca8b7e33974463e8087d6fafae262c6755d55b",
   "text": "使用医院的各项设施",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9ce28c2fb32420ff8348",
   "sourceHash": "9ce28c2fb32420ff83484114a141a435cdb89f7874f314884925a7a902eda6cb",
   "text": "每周的讲座、烹饪课程和农场漫步",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_88e0e6cd3bcc055f9683",
   "sourceHash": "88e0e6cd3bcc055f96835d703576b9739107659544e766890154d808e6dcccd3",
   "text": "公共区域 Wi-Fi",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_95508f934633fce32ac1",
   "sourceHash": "95508f934633fce32ac19cbd7621617620e62cb6a65cccc52616ddb1fa369b7e",
   "text": "需额外付费的服务包括机场/火车站接送、洗衣、专项外出活动、私人瑜伽/冥想课程，以及超出您处方安排的治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6c71c35cb831766e46f9",
   "sourceHash": "6c71c35cb831766e46f92a4e426336bdf398dcb95c7a270e1e40c6f6d5a85d55",
   "text": "我可以查看详细的价格明细吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c9f5922438b6207a937a",
   "sourceHash": "c9f5922438b6207a937a3d8035a75718afbd1e1ca0a502c44f2fe065e3a85dbc",
   "text": "可以。我们的价格表按别墅类型（Deluxe、Classic、Royal、Maharaja Suite）列出单人或双人入住的价格。如需包括餐饮和额外治疗在内的详细报价，请联系患者服务团队：+91 9555 156 156。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Villa category names kept verbatim as proper names."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d2ede9aed50f8069080",
   "sourceHash": "0d2ede9aed50f8069080873f5e7a6b9d41273c3df2bb56d19aa41a4abcbbcc7a",
   "text": "家属可以陪住吗？陪同人员需要付费吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_84fc4dbddb678786b383",
   "sourceHash": "84fc4dbddb678786b383432636dc98ac283a68093941502a2a8c00732d5017a0",
   "text": "可以，家属可以陪您同住。额外的成人需支付加床和额外餐饮费用：现行价格（有效期 2026 年 10 月 1 日至 2027 年 9 月 30 日）为加床每晚 ₹3,000 / $43 / €38，额外餐饮每晚 ₹5,500 / $79 / €69，在您的疗程价格之外另行收取。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bf554a149082d1495ad9",
   "sourceHash": "bf554a149082d1495ad9cd5a3d63d9eae089716b28245ee40a3a4ccb81ecb07c",
   "text": "别墅内有空调、Wi-Fi 和手机信号吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f118e96ca81e43ddf4fd",
   "sourceHash": "f118e96ca81e43ddf4fd7821244b5744effee4e9d8799d4d5d715e12cd5fdf2d",
   "text": "是的，每栋别墅均配有空调。公共区域提供 Wi-Fi。关于别墅内的 Wi-Fi 和手机网络覆盖情况，请在预订时向患者服务团队确认。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_925e1c8551f5218828c2",
   "sourceHash": "925e1c8551f5218828c2cbb2da7b1cd284aa0d5b01e8c230a82d2e0d89a72eee",
   "text": "两人可以同住一栋别墅并参加不同的疗程吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_713d6e5818e75f50f459",
   "sourceHash": "713d6e5818e75f50f45939d19f4f577b6f2d3434f39c3b2f377a5f36460d1d5f",
   "text": "可以，别墅按单人或双人入住定价，因此两人可以同住一栋别墅。价格按每人每个疗程报价，每位患者的疗程由医生在问诊时确定——预订时请告知患者服务团队您希望参加不同的疗程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2222a1700d631104199a",
   "sourceHash": "2222a1700d631104199a0540361f57fc3951a081b2d556e54541d6db5bbdccf1",
   "text": "饮食信息",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_228c096d748c1decf991",
   "sourceHash": "228c096d748c1decf991f32116cea49b73e68b6f61b69cba1ecd5fa25b50a08f",
   "text": "Kairali 提供什么样的饮食？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b3241adac297b69acece",
   "sourceHash": "b3241adac297b69acece1649b7c80e0a01736a33817fbbf7ad4552cae3229a69",
   "text": "我们提供按照阿育吠陀原则烹制的新鲜有机素食。餐食根据平衡您的体质（dosha）和支持您的治疗疗程而定制。食材主要来自我们园区内的有机菜园或当地农户，以确保最高的营养价值和最低的环境影响。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3f224a85ce27654e82b1",
   "sourceHash": "3f224a85ce27654e82b11bb7ab5cfa5fb027844b26e930d300a8be786a396e1a",
   "text": "你们能满足饮食限制或过敏方面的需求吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d31581c30ecb46ad6286",
   "sourceHash": "d31581c30ecb46ad6286177a2acbb69516cdd89e1cb718ec6fc32a3b8c9c2929",
   "text": "可以，我们可满足多种饮食需求，包括纯素、无麸质及针对过敏的特殊要求。请在预订时告知我们您的任何食物过敏或饮食限制，以便厨房做好相应准备。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_75b60fa8748c50343fc7",
   "sourceHash": "75b60fa8748c50343fc704365ce588c3a24ff04b7a67f188e9f44fca630e88da",
   "text": "治疗期间可以饮酒或喝咖啡吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8115f1c142466cdeebf6",
   "sourceHash": "8115f1c142466cdeebf646caa20646dedfed48eb7f088d26964fe978ae6f1923",
   "text": "我们强烈建议您在治疗期间不要饮酒，因为酒精会影响阿育吠陀药物的效果和排毒过程。为支持您的治疗，园区内禁酒且不提供含咖啡因的饮品。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8e504655782ef9cadb6f",
   "sourceHash": "8e504655782ef9cadb6f26d7a6f06ba6df2e244ae5852acaf026eaf2ab270c56",
   "text": "交通与出行安排",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3a2d816ef67909552ed4",
   "sourceHash": "3a2d816ef67909552ed4aa8a4073b32ae56591d87eeba7fcf9a1d4fd07e043c1",
   "text": "最近的机场和火车站是哪些？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
